No third-party Rust crates are vendored: src/rust/vendor.tar.xz carries only the hypercast core, this project's own work (Skunk Werkx, MIT), but for the Unicode data below.
The vendored hypercast crate's case folding (unicode/CaseFolding-17.0.0.txt and src/fold_table.rs, generated from it) is from the Unicode Character Database, (c) Unicode, Inc., Unicode License v3: https://www.unicode.org/license.txt
